    "Reverse entries are deliberately limited to relationships explicitly present in the normalized source layers.",
    "PQ36 remains unresolved and therefore has no reward relationships.",
    "The index is designed to be regenerated after future source verification rather than hand-edited indefinitely.",
    "DLC reverse entries now cover every explicit pq_requires_dlc edge in the current forward relationship layer.",
    "Farming reverse entries reflect explicit repeatable-route flags only; they do not assert guaranteed reward drops.",
    "Character reverse index remains empty until explicit character-feature edges are established; enemy appearance is not converted into reward attribution.",
    "2026-09-19: Added 24 canonical typed reward entries missing from the forward relationship layer (10 Super Souls, 14 equipment). Equipment subtype placement in this reverse index follows the canonical batch reward naming; source fields remain authoritative for exact subtype where provided.",
    "2026-09-19: Reverse index extended from the forward relationship layer after adding 46 source-normalized reward edges.",
    "2026-09-19: Subtype-aware reverse-index reconciliation added normalized-map clothing/accessory provenance without changing forward equipment relationship semantics. The forward layer intentionally uses one equipment relationship type; reverse index retains subtype where the source identifies it.",
    "2026-09-19: Final subtype audit removed legacy dual clothing/accessory placements where the normalized source explicitly classifies the item as an accessory. 122 forward equipment edges now have complete reverse coverage; subtype is only asserted where the source layer identifies it.",
    "2026-09-19: Added the nine explicitly listed PQ 12-14 reward relationships from the all-186 PQ guide. PQ 1 has no skill, Super Soul, or equipment reward in the source's Basic Reward list, so no typed relationship was fabricated.",
    "2026-09-28 reverse audit: added the missing derived clothing reverse endpoint for canonical PQ47 → Broly's Clothes; no canonical forward relationship was created here.",
    "2026-09-30 canonical-first repair: rebuilt skill, Super Soul, and DLC reverse buckets directly from the 899-row canonical PQ forward relationship store. Equipment remains partially projected because the forward schema intentionally does not encode clothing/accessory subtype for every equipment target; unresolved subtype identities are not guessed.",
    "2026-09-30 subtype recovery: populated 24 missing clothing/accessory reverse endpoints using explicit names in the canonical equipment/accessory record layers. Five equipment targets remain unclassified because neither canonical layer currently contains an exact name match: Android 13's Hat; Android 17 (DB Super) Wig; Videl T-Shirt; Gogeta's Clothes; Rakshasa's Claw."
